    <h1>Support</h1>
    <p class="meta">FunnyCamera (同框印记) · Last Updated: July 19, 2026</p>

    <p>
      Welcome to FunnyCamera support. If you need help with the App, subscriptions, permissions, or feature usage,
      please review the information below or contact us directly.
    </p>

    <div class="contact-card">
      <strong>Contact Email</strong>
      <a href="mailto:mimengtechcto@163.com">mimengtechcto@163.com</a>
      <p style="margin: 0.75rem 0 0; color: var(--muted);">
        We usually reply within 1–3 business days. Please include your device model, iOS version, and a brief description of the issue.
      </p>
    </div>

    <h2>1. Getting Started</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Dual Camera</strong> – capture front and back cameras at the same time. Some devices do not support dual video recording.</li>
      <li><strong>Watermark Check-in</strong> – add time, location, and template watermarks to your photos.</li>
      <li><strong>Creative Editor</strong> – edit photos with stickers, text, collage, crop, and export tools.</li>
      <li><strong>My Records</strong> – view locally saved works and check-in history on your device.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>2. Permissions</h2>
    <p>If a feature is unavailable, check iOS Settings and make sure the required permission is enabled for FunnyCamera:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Camera – required for capture features</li>
      <li>Microphone – required for video recording with sound</li>
      <li>Photo Library – required for importing and saving content</li>
      <li>Location – optional, used only for watermark/check-in location details</li>
      <li>Notifications – optional, used for local reminders</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>3. FunnyCamera Pro</h2>
    <p>Pro unlocks advanced export, watermark templates, creative assets, long-image stitching, and expanded dual-camera options.</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Weekly Pro</strong> – auto-renewing every week</li>
      <li><strong>Yearly Pro</strong> – auto-renewing every year</li>
      <li>Payment is processed by Apple through your Apple ID</li>
      <li>Use <strong>Restore</strong> in the App if you changed devices or reinstalled</li>
      <li>Manage or cancel subscriptions in iOS Settings &gt; Apple ID &gt; Subscriptions</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>4. Common Issues</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Subscription prices not loading</strong> – make sure you are connected to the internet and signed in with a valid Apple ID. New subscriptions may take time to become available in sandbox or App Store environments.</li>
      <li><strong>Restore did not work</strong> – confirm you are signed in with the same Apple ID used for purchase and try again from the subscription page.</li>
      <li><strong>Dual camera unavailable</strong> – your device may not support multi-camera capture or dual video output.</li>
      <li><strong>Photos not saved</strong> – verify Photo Library permission is granted and storage space is available.</li>
      <li><strong>Location not shown on watermark</strong> – enable Location permission and make sure location access is allowed while using the App.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>5. Data & Privacy</h2>
    <p>
      FunnyCamera is designed to work primarily on your device. We do not operate user accounts or cloud sync in the current version.
      For more details, see our <a href="privacy.html">Privacy Policy</a>.
    </p>

